@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-47 - View Return Request Detail

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Purchases / Returns UI" as FE
control "ReturnsController" as API
control "ReturnsService" as Service
database "MongoDB: returnRequests, bills" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-47
FE -> API: GET /returns
API -> Service: Execute View Return Request Detail
Service -> DB: Read/write returnRequests, bills
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Chi tiết return request hiển thị

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Return request tồn tại
Post: Chi tiết return request hiển thị
Main flow:
1. Admin click vào 1 return request
2. System gọi API GET /returns or GET /returns?status=... then select by\n_id
3. System trả về: orderCode, user info, product info, type, reason, note,\nimages, status, adminNote
end note
@enduml
